msgid "**Assignment is deterministic, never random.** It follows the row's index in the global discovery order and the sweep number, so re-running a sweep reproduces the run. Discovery order itself is stabilised by `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, which CI sets to the run id, so the plan table, the discover job and every chunk block of one run agree without passing state between them."
